#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:239
#: a4189420d1f74bb88986772d0a79b44c
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:241
#: e22886b1f37a4ab9bb320d595fd2475c
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used"
" for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 "
"which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this"
" manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚映射到定时器输入而非 UART，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外——它们需要真正的 UART 连接。不过 FPort 以这种方式连接时，可提供 RC 但没有数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:243
#: f4c143c4485645aeb3d537d4f267cc8a
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART must be used. For example, UART1 can have its "
"protocol changed from the default GPS protocol for GPS2 to RX input "
"protocol:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 CRSF 以及 Fport、CRSF、SRXL2 接收机内嵌的数传，必须使用完整的 UART。例如可把 UART1 的协议从默认的 GPS2 用"
" GPS 协议改为 RX 输入协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:245
#: 8bbe55c91da74e7e96975ea6ad735ddd
msgid "With this option, SERIAL4_PROTOCOL must be set to “23”, and:"
msgstr "选择此选项时，SERIAL4_PROTOCOL 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:247
#: 6dc581727dbb40019d87f96b15b35779
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:249
#: 3c1cd5a93663496f94791cc3567c5664
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX1 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:251
#: b3ae4fe6c882442aaeaa9ff461e4d6a7
msgid "FPort requires connection to TX1 and RX1. See FPort Receivers."
msgstr "FPort 需要同时连接 TX1 和 RX1。请参阅 FPort 接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:253
#: 969c24a3cb734bbd8745cdf6671fda0d
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要连接 TX1，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:255
#: da34334e011d42c5b8ce75cd095c841a
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" SERIAL4_OPTIONS to “4”."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要连接 TX1 并自动提供数传。将 SERIAL4_OPTIONS 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:257
#: b11ff297c8cd49b9b6139286cc40226f
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See Radio Control Systems for "
"details."
msgstr "ArduPilot 中任何 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详见无线电控制系统文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:260
#: e1b1020bc81e4e32b1924a8d84966056
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:262
#: 59c665d994b4402285270ffecaf518e2
msgid ""
"The A6SE supports up to 11 PWM outputs,support all PWM protocols as well as "
"DShot. All 11 PWM outputs have GND on the bottom row, 5V on the middle row "
"and signal on the top row."
msgstr ""
"A6SE 最多支持 11 路 PWM 输出，支持所有 PWM 协议以及 DShot。所有 11 路 PWM 输出底排为 GND，中排为 "
"5V，顶排为信号线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:264
#: fc35745f91e245ac8ea8b10f078eccd9
msgid "The 11 PWM outputs are in 3 groups:"
msgstr "11 路 PWM 输出分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:266
#: 681c838f64a04a959889d03ebfc5264b
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3、4 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:267
#: ddf02e16b1fa4c85a9c2ab5ee20f2a6b
msgid "PWM 5, 6, 7 and 8 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5、6、7、8 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:268
#: 85b08eb1cf904a138d0755b4da9f4e38
msgid "PWM 9, 10, 11 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 9、10、11 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:270
#: b5cddf04c24c41bbb6e3a679fef6f8a4
msgid ""
"Channels 1-8 support bi-directional Dshot. Channels within the same group "
"need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot, then"
" all channels in that group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率；组内只要有任一通道使用 DShot，该组所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:274
#: 7598224985554baf986185077f898e16
msgid "GPIOs"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:275
#: bfc4ae16cf04459997aaeb4311e3c6ae
msgid ""
"All 11 PWM channels can be used for GPIO functions (relays, buttons, RPM "
"etc)."
msgstr "所有 11 路 PWM 通道均可用于 GPIO 功能（继电器、按钮、转速等）。"

