msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:325
#: b6ff39382984440cae44a43e1efef3ff
msgid ""
"There is an on-board compass. Calibration is required (see :ref:`common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner`)."
msgstr "板载磁罗盘。需要校准（见 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:327
#: 8c20b8f203ae41c6825d47b3d86f7bdc
msgid ""
"on-board compasses are often close to battery lines and therefore subject to"
" interference and sometimes disabled, with external compasses being located "
"remotely to avoid this issue."
msgstr "板载磁罗盘往往离电池线很近，因此易受干扰，有时会被禁用；外置磁罗盘则安装在远处以避免此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:330
#: 3dda0363cea441afb32f735ad8698746
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:332
#: 5bb9e4edadb94c1396889a46a2012c37
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot compatible bootloader, "
"allowing the loading of xxxxxx.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot "
"compatible ground station."
msgstr "该板出厂预装 ArduPilot 兼容引导程序，可用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站加载 xxxxxx.apj 固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6se.rst:336
#: b993507a218549408b11fdc6b66ba958
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"YJUAV_A6SE\"."
msgstr ""
"该板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 找到，位于标有 「YJUAV_A6SE」 的子文件夹中。"
